{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","冰风龙卷"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Verdant Cyclone"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤魔法剑吸引附近敌人向中心聚拢，并造成伤害和定身。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Eironn summons magical swords, pulling nearby enemies to the center, dealing damage, and immobilizing them."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","埃隆将双剑力量合二为一，选择一个地图格，吸引附近2格范围内敌人将其向中心聚拢，短暂延迟后产生爆炸，对2格范围内的敌人造成250% + 20% ATK伤害，并定身3秒。优先选择敌人最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Eironn combines the power of two swords and selects a tile, pulling in enemies within 2 tiles to the center. Then causes an explosion after a short delay, dealing 250% + 20% ATK damage to enemies within 2 tiles and immobilizing them for 3s. Eironn prioritizes selecting a tile with the most surrounding enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":64,"end":70,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":167,"end":173,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":163,"end":177,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":215,"end":227,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 270% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[