/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","分别使用两把剑对范围内敌人造成伤害，并分别降低技能急速和魔法抗性。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Eironn deals AoE damage with two swords and reduces enemies' Haste and Magic DEF."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","埃隆首先对面前扇形3格范围内的敌人造成110% + 10% ATK伤害，降低其50点急速，持续5秒。随后对目标进行戳刺，对目标及其身后直线上2格的敌人造成220% + 20% ATK伤害，降低40%魔抗，持续5秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Eironn slashes to deal 110% + 10% ATK damage to enemies within a 3-tile arc and reduces their Haste by 50 for 5s. Later, Eironn stabs the target, dealing 220% + 20% ATK damage to the target and enemies in a 2-tile line behind them, reducing their Magic DEF by 40% for 5s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":81,"end":87,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":158,"end":164,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":154,"end":168,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","挥砍的伤害提升至115% + 10% ATK，戳刺的伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases slash damage to 115% + 10% ATK and stab damage to 230% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":64,"end":70,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spa