ltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","凛风护盾"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Tempest Guard"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自身添加护盾，并提供闪避效果。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Eironn gains a shield and the dodge chance."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","埃隆为自身添加一个护盾，护盾可抵挡280% + 30% ATK的伤害，持续10秒，护盾存在期间，自身获得50%闪避率。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Eironn gains a shield that blocks 280% + 30% ATK damage for 10s. Additionally, he gains 50% dodge chance while the shield is active."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":55,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"keyword:dodg"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":92,"end":104,"tooltip_key":"keyword:dodg"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases shield value to 300% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至320% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases shield value to 320% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","获得的闪避率提升至80%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases dodge chance to 80%."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":3,"end":6,"tooltip_key":"keyword:dodg"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":10,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:dodg"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身远程防御，当自身生命值较低时进一步提升远程防御。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Eironn increases his Ranged DEF during battle. He gains extra Ranged DEF when his HP is low."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点远程防御，且当自身生命值低于50%时，额外提升7点远程防御。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Eironn increases his Ranged DEF by 15 during battle. He gains an extra 7 Ranged DEF when his HP drops below 50% ."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高19点远程防御，且当自身生命值低于50%时，额外提升9点远程防御。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Eironn increases his Ranged DEF by 19 during battle. He gains an extra 9 Ranged DEF when his HP drops below 50% ."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高23点远程防御，且当自身生命值低于50%时，额外提升12点远程防御。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Eironn increases his Ranged DEF by 23 during battle. He gains an extra 12 Ranged DEF when his HP drops below 50% ."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","飓风呼啸"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Howling Hurricane"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始可直接在任意地图格释放一次终极技能。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Eironn can cast Verdant Cyclone on any tile once when a battle starts."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗中，埃隆的首次终极技能将不消耗能量。但伤害会减少至原本伤害的50%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Eironn casts Verdant Cyclone for the first time in each battle without consuming Energy, but the damage is reduced to 50% of the original."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害会减少至原本伤害的70%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage to 70% of the original."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","定身时间提升至6秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases immobilize duration to 6s."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害会减少至原本伤害的80%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Reduces damage to 80% of the original."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","被技能“冰风龙卷”定身的敌人受到额外魔抗降低。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Eironn reduces an extra Magic DEF on a target if they are immobilized by Verdant Cyclone."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被技能“冰风龙卷”定身的目标，在定身期间额外降低15%魔抗。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Eironn reduces an extra 15% Magic DEF on an immobilized target if they are immobilized by Verdant Cyclone."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":11,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"},{"start":16,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":44,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"},{"start":75,"end":86,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","冰风之歌"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Icewind Reverie"]]}